# Context Sources Registry
#
# Maps technology names to their official CONTEXT/LLMS file URLs.
# Used by `vibbly init` and `vibbly context update` to fetch current documentation.
#
# Format: technology_key|display_name|url|local_filename
# Lines starting with # are comments. Empty lines are ignored.
#
# Stack mappings (which contexts to fetch per stack):
#   webapp-rails: tailwind, rails, hotwire, flyio
#   webapp-svelte: tailwind, svelte, sveltekit, flyio
#   webapp-fastapi-svelte: tailwind, svelte, sveltekit, fastapi, flyio
#   backend-cli: (none)
#   backend-api: fastapi, flyio
#   godot: godot
#
# Conditional (fetched only when UI_COMPONENTS=flowbite in 02-project.md):
#   webapp-rails + flowbite: + flowbite, flowbite-rails
#   webapp-svelte + flowbite: + flowbite-svelte
#   webapp-fastapi-svelte + flowbite: + flowbite-svelte

# UI Styling (always for web stacks)
tailwind|Tailwind CSS|https://tailwindcss.com/llms-full.txt|tailwind.md

# UI Components (conditional — only when UI_COMPONENTS=flowbite)
flowbite|Flowbite|https://flowbite.com/docs/getting-started/llms-txt/|flowbite.md
flowbite-svelte|Flowbite Svelte|https://flowbite-svelte.com/llms-full.txt|flowbite-svelte.md
flowbite-rails|Flowbite Rails|https://flowbite.com/docs/getting-started/rails/|flowbite-rails.md

# Frontend
svelte|Svelte 5|https://svelte.dev/llms-full.txt|svelte.md
sveltekit|SvelteKit|https://svelte.dev/docs/kit/llms-full.txt|sveltekit.md

# Testing
playwright|Playwright|https://playwright.dev/docs/llms.txt|playwright.md

# Backend
rails|Ruby on Rails|https://guides.rubyonrails.org/llms.txt|rails.md
hotwire|Hotwire (Turbo + Stimulus)|https://hotwired.dev/llms.txt|hotwire.md
fastapi|FastAPI|https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/llms-full.txt|fastapi.md

# Deploy
flyio|Fly.io|https://fly.io/docs/llms.txt|flyio.md

# Game
godot|Godot Engine|https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/llms.txt|godot.md
